{"name":"Lioness","hex":"#e0af47","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Lioness","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A player for England women's national football team"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Lioness"}],"entries":[{"title":"Lion","blocks":[{"text":"The lion is a large cat of the genus Panthera, currently ranging only in Sub-Saharan Africa and India. It has a muscular, broad-chested body; a short, rounded head; round ears; and a dark, hairy tuft at the tip of its tail. It is sexually dimorphic; adult male lions are larger than females and have a prominent mane that extends from the head to the shoulders and chest."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/020_The_lion_king_Snyggve_in_the_Serengeti_National_Park_Photo_by_Giles_Laurent.jpg/330px-020_The_lion_king_Snyggve_in_the_Serengeti_National_Park_Photo_by_Giles_Laurent.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lion","wikidata":"Q140"},{"title":"Lioness Records","blocks":[{"text":"Lioness Records is a British record label, founded in 2009 by British singer Amy Winehouse. Winehouse stated she was inspired by Berry Gordy's Motown Records, and The Specials' 2 Tone Records to create her own label."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d7/Lioness_Records_logo.jpg/330px-Lioness_Records_logo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lioness_Records","wikidata":"Q2085941"},{"title":"Lioness (American TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Lioness, also marketed as Special Ops: Lioness, is an American spy thriller television series created by Taylor Sheridan that premiered on July 23, 2023, on Paramount+. The second season premiered on October 27, 2024. In October 2025, the series was renewed for a third season, which premiered on August 2, 2026."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/64/Lioness_%282025%29_title_card.jpg/330px-Lioness_%282025%29_title_card.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lioness_(American_TV_series)","wikidata":"Q116199566"},{"title":"Lioness (2008 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Lioness is a 2008 documentary film directed by Meg McLagan and Daria Sommers about the first members of Team Lioness. \nThis feature-length documentary tells the story of a group of Army servicewomen who went to Iraq as clerks, mechanics and engineers but ended up fighting alongside the infantryman in some of the bloodiest battles of the Iraq war."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lioness_(2008_film)","wikidata":"Q12125746"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Okonjima_Lioness.jpg/500px-Okonjima_Lioness.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Okonjima_Lioness.jpg/1280px-Okonjima_Lioness.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Okonjima_Lioness.jpg/500px-Okonjima_Lioness.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOkonjima_Lioness.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Flickr_-_Rainbirder_-_Sassy_Lassy_white_background.jpg/500px-Flickr_-_Rainbirder_-_Sassy_Lassy_white_background.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Flickr_-_Rainbirder_-_Sassy_Lassy_white_background.jpg/500px-Flickr_-_Rainbirder_-_Sassy_Lassy_white_background.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFlickr_-_Rainbirder_-_Sassy_Lassy_white_background.jpg"},{"